  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "When Pi Shui Han vents after escaping life chasing fire, the battle draws in two rank six peak Gu Immortals: Qie Shi Min of the enslavement path and Half Moon Brutemaster of the moon path. They have pretty good relationships with a certain demonic path Gu Immortal, so they intervene and mediate, and push Pi Shui Han toward Dong Fang tribe’s main camp instead of Tai Qiu. Pi Shui Han hears that Half Moon Brutemaster holds an Immortal Gu that can pierce space and enter Jade Pool blessed land, and at that land Half Moon Brutemaster forms a pathway in. When Fang Yuan’s group arrives, Half Moon Brutemaster shouts that he spent effort creating the hole and unleashes a killer move, which Fang Yuan’s strength path giant hands destroy effortlessly.",
      "chapters": [
        795
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_pi_shui_han",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "char_qie_shi_min",
        "fac_dong_fang_tribe",
        "loc_tai_qiu",
        "sys_immortal_gu",
        "loc_jade_pool_blessed_land",
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He has a shiny forehead. Cold sweat seeps from it.",
      "chapters": [
        797
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Beside Qie Shi Min he looks much inferior to Pi Shui Han once Fairy Li Shan and Hei Lou Lan reveal their strength, and both regret attacking before reading the field.",
      "chapters": [
        796
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "jade-pool-scramble",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fairy_li_shan",
        "char_hei_lou_lan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Later he watches Fang Yuan maul a desolate beast shark fin wolf, cold sweat on his forehead, then flees after Fang Yuan looks his way, deciding the man is too savage to face again.",
      "chapters": [
        797
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "jade-pool-scramble",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "When the demonic path Gu Immortals turn on Dong Fang Chang Fan he shouts to kill him so Jade Pool blessed land would be theirs.",
      "chapters": [
        801
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "jade-pool-scramble",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_dong_fang_chang_fan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In the chase out of the land he is left in the dust with Zhuo Zhan, Shi Hou, and others, with no third wave at all.",
      "chapters": [
        804
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "jade-pool-scramble",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_zhuo_zhan",
        "char_shi_hou"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "A later scramble over Hei tribe resources lists him with the Traveling Three Elites, Old Lu, and Zhuo Zhan among demonic path Gu Immortals competing for those holdings.",
      "chapters": [
        1104
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
